---
title: SD-04 Inventory - Adjust Stock
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Stock Manager
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as Inventory API
    participant S as InventoryService
    participant D as SQL Server
    M->>F: Select batch, quantity change, reason
    F->>A: POST /api/stock-adjustments (JWT)
    A->>A: Authorize role = Stock Manager
    A->>S: AdjustStock(dto, userId)
    S->>D: BEGIN TRANSACTION, load batch
    D-->>S: Batch (QuantityRemaining)
    alt Reason missing or stock would go below 0
        S->>D: ROLLBACK
        S-->>A: Business error
        A-->>F: 400 + message
        F-->>M: Show error
    else Valid
        S->>D: Update Batch.QuantityRemaining
        S->>D: Insert StockMovement (Adjustment, reason)
        S->>D: COMMIT
        S-->>A: Updated batch
        A-->>F: 200 OK
        F-->>M: Show updated stock
    end
    Note over S,D: Adjustment needs a reason and is logged in StockMovement
